# adamfit: expression shapes fitted by Adam, priced, measured, the closest
# certified (src/adamfit.c).  Small budgets: count and steps keep it quick.
adamfit cos(x) in 0..1 count 160 steps 40 auto list 3
adamfit sin(x) in 0..0.5 count 100 steps 40 wcost 2 werr 0.2 list 2
fit exp(x) on 0..1 with adam count 100 steps 30 list 2 and just report the closest
adamfit x*y in 0..1
adamfit cos(x) in 0..1 ops sqrt
